      "id": "s14",
      "type": "QUIZ_CARD",
      "transition": "dip",
      "background": "zoneB",
      "narration": "Quick one. You're testing that an admin can ban a user, and the test needs five users to already exist. What's the best setup? Have a think. Ready? It's B. The signup form isn't what you're testing today — it's scenery.",
